 64	/// Shared "resting until" deadline (ms timestamp). Set by a mode when the pet
 65	/// reaches a destination / edge and should pause. The engine loop keeps
 66	/// ticking at 30ms while resting, so drag, mood changes, and mode switches
 67	/// stay responsive , the modes just no-op until the deadline passes.
 68	let restUntil = 0;
